# TEST_TIMEOUT, TEST_PATHS, TEST_CLEANUP_CMD (not needed here). Scoped to the
# docker-release helper-mode guard (PR #38, SC-14): the full scripts/tests
# suite is not gated here because it is red on main (test_action_pins: version
